    <string name="onb_intro_heading">How Fasting Shift works</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_timer_title">One tap, and it never loses a fast</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_timer_body">Start and end with a single tap. Your fast is saved the moment it starts, so it survives restarts, flat batteries and time-zone changes.</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_safety_title">Safety built in</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_safety_body">A few honest questions decide which fasts we offer. Longer fasts come with a checklist, check-ins and gentle guidance for breaking them.</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_privacy_title">Your fasting records</string>
    <string name="onb_intro_privacy_body">No account is required. Your fasting and health records are encrypted on this device. You choose whether to use Health Connect or save a copy to a file.</string>
